sequenceDiagram
    actor Member
    actor Admin
    participant Site
    participant Record as Record <<database>>

    Note over Member,Site: MEMBER ACTIONS (blue)
    Member->>Site: Find sessions that cannot be attended\n(date & location)
    Member->>Site: Request makeup sessions\n(date & location + capacity check)

    Note over Member,Record: DATABASE UPDATES (green)
    Member->>Record: Update attendance status\n& save changes
    activate Record
    Record-->>Admin: Notify of changes
    Record-->>Site: Update member schedule
    deactivate Record

    Note over Site,Member: FINAL OUTPUT (orange)
    Site-->>Member: Final confirmation with details
